// Block predicates (`block_predicate_filter`), flattened. kind: 0 always,
// 1 blocks (`ref` is a `|` list), 2 all_of, 3 any_of, 4 not, 5 would_survive
// (`a` is a state index), 6 solid, 7 has_sturdy_face, 8 replaceable, 9 fluids.
// Every row carries the predicate's own `offset`, which the runtime applies
// before testing the position (containers included, as vanilla's
// `BlockPredicate.of` does).
